    <description>Dear Telco TCS, please review your open cases.
PECS Service Level Agreements (SLAs) - changed to Priority as of Apr 2018
Target: resolve more than 80% of Priority &quot;Critical&quot; in &lt;50 days and &quot;High&quot; in &lt;75 days
https://wiki.ith.intel.com/x/urBnNQ</description>
